  "imagery": "Imagery is sparse and intentional. The hero features no photography — only a diagonal yellow gradient beam as an abstract light effect. Portfolio sections display product screenshots inside 14px-radius frames, presented as evidence of work rather than lifestyle context. The visual language is: no people, no environments, no mood photography. When images appear, they are tight product crops on pure surfaces — the work itself is the hero, not the designer. Icons are minimal and outline-style (the small glyph in the nav capsule). The overall density is text-dominant: typography occupies more visual space than any image.",
